SetAllowed_Integration_Concrete_Test
├── when caller not owner
│  └── it should revert
└── when caller owner
   ├── when vault zero
   │  └── it should revert with ZeroAddress
   └── when vault non zero
      ├── given allowed false
      │  ├── given prior entry true
      │  │  ├── it should clear the entry
      │  │  └── it should emit MarketAllowed false
      │  └── given no prior entry
      │     ├── it should leave the entry false
      │     └── it should emit MarketAllowed false
      └── given allowed true
         ├── given prior entry false
         │  ├── it should set the entry true
         │  └── it should emit MarketAllowed true
         └── given prior entry true
            └── it should be idempotent
